        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 ofd: avoid assertion on large read request",
        "message": "LU-10026 ofd: avoid assertion on large read request\n\nIn case an old client using CSDC sends a\nread IO that will overflow buffers on OST, OST should\nreturn an error rather than crash.\n\nA similar check was previously added to the write path,\nbut was not added to the read path.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10359\nSigned-off-by: Artem Blagodarenko <ablagodarenko@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I7dc4c1a7a19c71d757d0a505003c3012edbf987a\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
